      <activity id="4c7fbcc7-889d-53de-b363-84d8f87ec969" activityNameId="e5186f2e-f2d3-5ddf-8cf1-3b7af829026f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Copper collector foil production, for Li-ion battery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Copper collector foil production, for Li-ion battery
The activity starts with aluminium alloy and chemicals entering the factory. The activity ends with the production of aluminium current collector foil at the factory gate.; UUID: d7bf6574-64be-3923-bec3-bd1b013cfc0c
The dataset represents the production of 1 kg aluminium foil to be used as current collector for the positive electrode (cathode) in Lithium-ion battery. Input materials for pre-treatment, infrastructure and waste are included.
Location: Data for copper collector foils, global average
Technology: Copper collector foil for Lithium ion batteries, NMC111.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d7bf6574-64be-3923-bec3-bd1b013cfc0c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
